   * @param connection
   * @param body Wishlist browsing criteria including pagination, search, and sorting options for the authenticated customer.
   * @x-autobe-authorization-type null
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor customer
   * @x-autobe-specification Load the authenticated customer context and resolve that customer's wishlist container and wishlist items. Query wishlist items joined to current product rows, and exclude items whose referenced product no longer exists or is no longer eligible for browsing. Return a paginated projection of saved products suitable for UI display.
